{"id":"930d23349770c79c","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-parseval.md","title":"Fourier Inversion and Parseval Identity","display":"thm-parseval — Fourier Inversion and Parseval Identity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-parseval","aliases":["28-thm-parseval"],"display":"thm-parseval — Fourier Inversion and Parseval Identity","depends_on":["[[28-df-fourier-transform]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §22.5.1 and Lemma 22.19","source_printed_pages":"476","source_pdf_pages":"502","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-parseval"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-parseval</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-parseval — Fourier Inversion and Parseval Identity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §22.5.1 and Lemma 22.19"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"476"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"502"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S),\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\">\\(\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S),\\langle f,g\\rangle_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S,T\\subseteq[n]\\ \\langle\\chi_S,\\chi_T\\rangle_n=\\mathbf1[S=T].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S,T\\subseteq[n]\\ \\langle\\chi_S,\\chi_T\\rangle_n=\\mathbf1[S=T].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\\ f(x)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)\\chi_S(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\\ f(x)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)\\chi_S(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle f,g\\rangle_n=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)\\widehat g(S),\\qquad2^{-n}\\sum_xf(x)^2=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle f,g\\rangle_n=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)\\widehat g(S),\\qquad2^{-n}\\sum_xf(x)^2=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>当 S≠T，字符乘积含一个独立均匀符号坐标，均值为零；S=T 时乘积为一。2^n 个正交非零字符在 2^n 维函数空间中构成基，因此得到反演。展开两函数的内积并消去交叉项即得 Parseval。n=0 时也成立。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§22.5.1 and Lemma 22.19，印刷页 476，PDF 页 502。已比对陈述。本次复核来源证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-fourier-transform]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$；$\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S),\\langle f,g\\rangle_n$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:\\{-1,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S,\\widehat f(S),\\langle f,g\\rangle_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall S,T\\subseteq[n]\\ \\langle\\chi_S,\\chi_T\\rangle_n=\\mathbf1[S=T].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\{-1,1\\}^n\\ f(x)=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)\\chi_S(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle f,g\\rangle_n=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)\\widehat g(S),\\qquad2^{-n}\\sum_xf(x)^2=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[n]}\\widehat f(S)^2.","display":true}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第22章：傅里叶分析工具：[[28-df-fourier-influence]]、[[28-thm-parseval]]。"}],"outgoing":["fcbf14393ebfa830"]}